{"id":"u-a38b078a-1210-4e3c-8868-f96389749b11","src":"community","title":"THE FORGE PROTOCOL\nBuild Strength. Move Better.","author":"Robin Fernando Rodriguez Ceballos","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/SWKcHi-the-forge-protocol-build-strength-move-better","desc":"This is not just another training program.\nThis is a system built with intention.\n\nIn a world where most people train only for appearance or numbers, this program was designed to go further—to build a body that doesn’t just look strong, but moves with purpose, performs under pressure, and endures over time.\n\nTHE FORGE PROTOCOL is built on three pillars:\nforging real strength, mastering movement, and developing a resilient body.\n\nHere, strength is not pursued recklessly.\nIt is refined through control.\nMovement is not an afterthought—it is trained, practiced, and owned.\nAnd resilience is not optional—it is the foundation.\n\nThis program combines structured strength training, hypertrophy, calisthenics, and athletic conditioning into one cohesive system. Every exercise, every progression, every detail serves a purpose:\nto create a body that is powerful, controlled, and built to last.\n\nBecause in the end, the goal is not just to lift more weight…\nIt’s to become someone who is capable, adaptable, and unbreakable.\n\nESPAÑOL:\n\nEste no es otro programa de entrenamiento.\nEste es un sistema construido con intención.\n\nEn un mundo donde la mayoría entrena solo por estética o por números, este programa fue diseñado para ir más allá: para construir un cuerpo que no solo se vea fuerte, sino que se mueva con propósito, rinda bajo presión y perdure en el tiempo.\n\nTHE FORGE PROTOCOL se basa en tres pilares:\nforjar fuerza real, dominar el movimiento y desarrollar un cuerpo resiliente.\n\nAquí, la fuerza no se persigue de manera imprudente.\nSe construye con control.\nEl movimiento no es un complemento, es una habilidad que se entrena y se perfecciona.\nY la resiliencia no es opcional, es la base.\n\nEste programa combina entrenamiento de fuerza estructurado, hipertrofia, calistenia y acondicionamiento atlético en un solo sistema coherente. Cada ejercicio, cada progresión y cada detalle tiene un propósito:\ncrear un cuerpo fuerte, controlado y preparado para durar.\n\nPorque al final, el objetivo no es solo levantar más peso…\nEs convertirte en alguien capaz, adaptable e inquebrantable.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Strength","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":7,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-05-26T07:26:10.829Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Pull Day","Push Day","Leg Day","Upper Body","Lower Body"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Cardio","sets":[{"sec":600,"rpe":6}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":6},{"lo":4,"hi":6,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Barbell Row","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Straight Arm Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":7,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Cardio","sets":[{"sec":600,"rpe":6}]},{"n":"Ring Dip","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":6},{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Scapular Push Up","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Pallof Press","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Dead Bug","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":7,"x":2}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Cardio","sets":[{"sec":600,"rpe":6}]},{"n":"Pistol Squat","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n